  "description": "Eight-minute AMRAP where the handstand push-ups climb by 3 each round (3, 6, 9…) and the cleans at 185/125 lb climb by 3 every third round (3, 3, 3, 6, 6, 6, 9…). A strict-standard HSPU test with a heavy bar for recovery. Scaled was a simple AMRAP of 10 push presses and 10 cleans at 95/65 and 115/75 lb.",
